# 运行时数据 / runtime data
shots_data/

# 构建产物 / build output
dist/
build/
.build_venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.spec.bak

# 更新备份 / update backups
backup/

# 本机设置与翻译缓存 —— 里面可能存有 API key,绝不入库
# Local settings and translation cache — may hold an API key; never commit these
settings.json
translations.json
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem

# Android
node_modules/
android/.gradle/
android/local.properties
*.apk
*.aab

# 由 `npx cap add android` 生成的整个原生工程 —— 是构建产物,不入库。
#
# 我们手写的原生代码在 android/app/src/main/ 下(仓库里有),构建时由
# scripts/sync_android.sh 叠加到生成工程上。把生成工程也提交进来的话,
# 等于同时维护两份 Capacitor 脚手架,两边迟早不一致。
#
# The whole native project produced by `npx cap add android` is build output and
# is not committed.
#
# Our hand-written native code lives under android/app/src/main/ (which IS in the
# repository) and is overlaid onto the generated project at build time by
# scripts/sync_android.sh. Committing the generated project too would mean
# maintaining two copies of the Capacitor scaffolding, and they would drift.
android/android/
android/app/build/
android/build/

# 本地提醒文档(不入库)
#
# 操作性笔记:发版规则、换编号时要删哪些旧 tag、怎么造一个「旧版本」APK 来测更新。
# 里面记了设备序列号和历史 SHA 这类不该公开的东西,所以留在本机。
#
# Local reminders, never committed. Operational notes: release rules, which old tags
# to delete when the numbering scheme changes, and how to build an "old version" APK
# to exercise the updater. It records device serials and historical SHAs, which is why
# it stays local.
docs/REMINDERS.md

# macOS
.DS_Store
